      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stella%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After the old building was removed, the site became Stella Veterans Memorial Park, honoring local veterans.",
